@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 登记读者（IntelliJ HTTP Client 自动保存返回的 ID）
POST {{baseUrl}}/readers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"张三"}

> {% client.global.set("readerId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. 图书和两个副本入库；重复执行请更换条码
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":"领域驱动设计",
  "author":"Eric Evans",
  "category":"技术",
  "barcodes":["DDD-001","DDD-002"]
}

> {%
client.global.set("bookId", response.body.id);
client.global.set("copyId", response.body.copies[0].id);
%}

### 3. 浏览
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?q=领域&category=技术&page=0&size=20

### 4. 详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}

### 5. 借阅（省略 copyId 可以自动分配）
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
X-Reader-Id: {{readerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookId":"{{bookId}}","copyId":"{{copyId}}"}

> {% client.global.set("loanId", response.body.id); %}

### 6. 续借一次
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/renewal
X-Reader-Id: {{readerId}}

### 7. 当前借阅（含逾期）
GET {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/loans?status=active&page=0&size=20
X-Reader-Id: {{readerId}}

### 8. 归还
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/return
X-Reader-Id: {{readerId}}

### 9. 历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/readers/me/loans?status=all
X-Reader-Id: {{readerId}}

### 10. 下架已归还的副本（仍保留另一个副本）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/copies/{{copyId}}

### 11. 增加副本
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/copies
Content-Type: application/json

{"barcode":"DDD-003"}
